(v)each business for which the Authority has granted approval to the bank under section 30(1)(e) of the Act and the approval is subject to conditions that include the bank having to treat the balance sheet asset value or exposures (whichever is higher) of the business as part of its aggregate non-financial business size;
(vi)each business carried on by any major stake entity of the bank, other than a business mentioned in section 30(1)(a), (b), (c) or (d) of the Act, where —
